---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Texoma Storm Shelters | FEMA-Certified Safe Room Specialists in Texoma & North Texas"
  description="Texoma Storm Shelters: Your trusted source for FEMA-certified storm shelters and safe rooms in North Texas. Protect your family. Call (903) 884-7210."
  canonical="https://texomatornadoshelters.com/about/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://texomatornadoshelters.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://texomatornadoshelters.com/about/"}]}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Where are your storm shelters manufactured?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Our steel safe rooms and reinforced concrete shelters are fabricated in compliance with Texas Tech Wind Institute and FEMA P-320 standards."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are your installation technicians certified?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Our installation crews are factory-trained, licensed, and insured, specializing in structural concrete anchoring and precision excavation."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you offer financing for storm shelter installations?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, we provide flexible financing options to help North Texas homeowners secure certified storm protection with manageable monthly payments."}}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #2B3A44; }
  .rich a { color: #1273A8; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #08344B 0%, #0E4D6E 65%, #08344B 100%);padding:72px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">About Texoma Storm Shelters</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Dedicated to protecting North Texas families with engineered, life-safety storm shelter solutions.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+19038847210" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (903) 884-7210</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="About Texoma Storm Shelters" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Texoma Storm Shelters was established to bring certified, engineered tornado safety solutions to homeowners, rural acreage properties, and commercial facilities across North Texas and the Red River valley.</p><p>Living in Tornado Alley means severe weather is not a matter of if, but when. We specialize in FEMA P-320 and ICC-500 compliant above-ground safe rooms, underground outdoor bunkers, and garage in-floor shelters that provide impenetrable refuge during violent supercell storms.</p><p>Our team works directly with local municipal inspectors in Sherman, Denison, and across Grayson County to ensure every installation exceeds strict structural codes and is properly registered with local emergency dispatch services.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Life-Safety Engineering</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We never cut corners on steel gauge, bolt tensile strength, or impact testing ratings.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Turnkey Local Service</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">From site inspection and permit filing to crane rigging and anchor bolting, we handle the entire project.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Transparent Pricing & Rebate Support</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">No surprise fees. We actively assist homeowners with Grayson County 50% rebate paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Local Emergency Integration</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Every shelter is GPS mapped and logged with municipal emergency management teams for post-storm rescue.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>
  </div></section>
<section style="padding:72px 24px;background:#EAF5FB;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Where are your storm shelters manufactured?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Our steel safe rooms and reinforced concrete shelters are fabricated in compliance with Texas Tech Wind Institute and FEMA P-320 standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Are your installation technicians certified?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes. Our installation crews are factory-trained, licensed, and insured, specializing in structural concrete anchoring and precision excavation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 10px;">Do you offer financing for storm shelter installations?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes, we provide flexible financing options to help North Texas homeowners secure certified storm protection with manageable monthly payments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0E4D6E 0%, #16648C 50%, #0E4D6E 100%);padding:64px 24px;text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;">Need Help in Texoma & North Texas? Call for Same-Day Service.</h2>
  <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Free written estimates. Emergency calls answered around the clock.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a href="tel:+19038847210" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (903) 884-7210</a>
    <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get Free Estimate</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
